### 게시물 올리기에 사진을 담아 보내기
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=photo-boundary

--photo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

제주 바다
--photo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="beach.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photos/beach.jpg
--photo-boundary--


### 사진 두 장 올리기
# @name uploaded
POST http://localhost:3000/api/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=photo-boundary

--photo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="beach.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photos/beach.jpg
--photo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="beach.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photos/forest.jpg
--photo-boundary--


### 5MB가 넘는 사진
POST http://localhost:3000/api/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=photo-boundary

--photo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="big.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photos/big.jpg
--photo-boundary--

### 사진이 아닌 파일
POST http://localhost:3000/api/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=photo-boundary

--photo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="memo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./photos/memo.txt
--photo-boundary--